WEBVTT

01:13.690 --> 01:18.170
[Meet Yourself]

01:18.950 --> 01:24.270
[Episode 36]

01:25.396 --> 01:30.636
On the... On the moon,

01:34.116 --> 01:35.436
there is...

02:16.126 --> 02:17.126
Dad.

02:18.316 --> 02:19.396
What are you looking at?

02:19.966 --> 02:20.516
Yao.

02:20.517 --> 02:21.766
What are you doing?

02:22.476 --> 02:25.636
Aunt asked me to pick you up for fear that
you're drunk.

02:26.036 --> 02:27.836
Don't worry.

02:29.246 --> 02:30.246
What are you looking at?

02:31.406 --> 02:32.566
The light.

02:34.036 --> 02:37.566
When we installed the light,
your grandpa said

02:37.846 --> 02:40.796
our village is the
same as the city.

02:41.476 --> 02:43.636
I asked him what
the city is like.

02:44.856 --> 02:45.886
He said there are

02:46.296 --> 02:47.296
bright lights,

02:47.446 --> 02:49.606
many people and busy traffic.

02:54.756 --> 02:55.795
I can lend a hand.

02:55.796 --> 02:57.486
No, thanks.

02:58.246 --> 02:59.356
Fine.

03:10.196 --> 03:12.956
What are you chatting
with Grandpa Yang?

03:13.166 --> 03:14.886
Nothing.

03:16.196 --> 03:21.486
Just about my childhood memory of your grandpa.

03:22.566 --> 03:24.446
Then we scolded Deqing.

03:29.446 --> 03:33.326
People become stubborn when they get old.

03:34.246 --> 03:35.956
I can still scold him.

03:36.636 --> 03:37.886
Maybe I can't do that

03:38.126 --> 03:39.606
two years later.

03:39.966 --> 03:43.606
I can only gasp when I get angry.

03:47.916 --> 03:53.726
Did my grandpa just gasp before he died?

04:05.446 --> 04:06.446
Yao.

04:07.286 --> 04:09.486
Don't think about it anymore.

04:10.606 --> 04:12.315
I don't.

04:12.316 --> 04:13.926
I just mention it.

04:17.246 --> 04:20.076
You always blame me for that.

04:21.446 --> 04:22.806
No.

04:25.686 --> 04:27.516
You blame me for not telling you.

04:29.756 --> 04:31.595
You didn't live with me when young.

04:31.596 --> 04:33.006
You're unfamiliar with me.

04:33.786 --> 04:35.396
Two years ago,

04:36.686 --> 04:39.596
I didn't help you
but troubled you.

04:41.006 --> 04:43.565
Why do you criticize yourself suddenly?

04:43.566 --> 04:44.515
Nonsense.

04:44.516 --> 04:45.956
Are you drunk?

04:46.566 --> 04:47.716
No.

04:51.836 --> 04:52.836
Yao.

04:54.006 --> 04:59.076
You and your girlfriend can focus on work.

04:59.686 --> 05:00.926
If you have a baby,

05:01.126 --> 05:02.326
I'll take care of it.

05:03.396 --> 05:04.886
Come on.

05:06.396 --> 05:08.076
Do you still blame me?

05:08.606 --> 05:12.396
You said we're unfamiliar
since I didn't live with you.

05:13.956 --> 05:14.956
It makes sense.

05:16.156 --> 05:16.636
OK.

05:16.637 --> 05:18.155
Take care of your kid.

05:18.156 --> 05:20.126
It's not related in any way.

05:21.046 --> 05:25.836
I'll buy you a beautiful and big babysitter car.

05:27.196 --> 05:29.836
You'd better leave the money to Yuan.

05:30.076 --> 05:32.516
He won't make any achievements.

05:33.716 --> 05:34.836
You're his brother.

05:35.076 --> 05:36.315
You don't care?

05:36.316 --> 05:37.925
I'm his brother, not dad.

05:37.926 --> 05:39.376
I shouldn't be responsible.

05:39.926 --> 05:43.326
And you said my work was useless

05:43.566 --> 05:45.396
and I would beg for food.

05:45.756 --> 05:47.126
When did I say that?

05:48.126 --> 05:51.126
When I built the yard.

05:51.956 --> 05:53.636
No, I didn't.

05:54.396 --> 05:55.836
You don't admit it?

05:56.276 --> 05:57.886
It's no way that I said it.

05:58.686 --> 05:59.686
Fine.

05:59.956 --> 06:02.326
Hope you can remember when you're sober.

06:02.516 --> 06:04.605
Sober? I didn't drink.

06:04.606 --> 06:06.195
Your aunt doesn't allow it.

06:06.196 --> 06:06.956
Really?

06:06.957 --> 06:09.516
Grandpa Yang was drunk
and lay on the ground.

06:10.606 --> 06:11.316
I didn't drink.

06:11.317 --> 06:12.355
You didn't?

06:12.356 --> 06:12.716
Come on.

06:12.717 --> 06:13.715
Go straight.

06:13.716 --> 06:15.515
It's a straight line.

06:15.516 --> 06:18.925
I have been walking straight from there.

06:18.926 --> 06:19.395
Really?

06:19.396 --> 06:19.995
Come on.

06:19.996 --> 06:21.276
Let me lend you a hand.

06:24.446 --> 06:29.366
How many children do you want in the future?

06:37.586 --> 06:43.106
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

06:44.986 --> 06:49.515
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

06:49.516 --> 06:50.635
Hongdou.

06:50.636 --> 06:51.716
Give me your hand.

06:52.886 --> 06:54.276
No nail polish.

06:54.636 --> 06:56.246
I don't mean that.

06:56.486 --> 06:57.486
Give me.

06:58.656 --> 07:03.955
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

07:03.956 --> 07:05.246
It just fits.

07:06.126 --> 07:07.805
I already have three bracelets.

07:07.806 --> 07:08.805
Don't make anymore.

07:08.806 --> 07:10.396
No more space to wear.

07:10.926 --> 07:14.206
Each bracelet is different in effects.

07:14.566 --> 07:17.596
Obsidian helps profit and avoid gain.

07:17.886 --> 07:20.075
White crystal purifies the soul.

07:20.076 --> 07:22.886
And pink crystal is helpful for love.

07:23.076 --> 07:24.766
Just one unfinished.

07:24.956 --> 07:26.036
What's this?

07:27.516 --> 07:28.516
Power.

07:28.806 --> 07:29.806
Single.

07:30.006 --> 07:31.006
Married.

07:31.396 --> 07:32.315
Unmarried.

07:32.316 --> 07:34.955
And courtship.

07:34.956 --> 07:36.045
Chen Nanxing.

07:36.046 --> 07:37.485
The exam is coming.

07:37.486 --> 07:39.836
See which crystal can help you pass the exam.

07:40.276 --> 07:42.275
Make a bracelet for yourself.

07:42.276 --> 07:45.366
You don't know how
happy it is to be in love,

07:45.686 --> 07:49.635
like a hundred butterflies
fluttering in your heart.

07:49.636 --> 07:51.246
You smile in a different way.

07:53.396 --> 07:54.516
Will you study?

07:55.006 --> 07:56.685
Study how to find a boyfriend.

07:56.686 --> 07:57.686
Study.

07:59.076 --> 08:00.636
Love makes me happy.

08:01.716 --> 08:03.366
But failure will make you sad.

08:06.566 --> 08:08.075
Don't remove it.

08:08.076 --> 08:09.955
It takes me a long time.

08:09.956 --> 08:11.836
I forget to cut it.

08:32.846 --> 08:34.566
Can't you make a call?

08:52.886 --> 08:53.486
Here you are.

08:53.487 --> 08:55.806
♫ A beautiful smile ♫

08:56.886 --> 09:00.885
♫ Although the seasons go by ♫

09:00.886 --> 09:02.405
I'll go to the tie-dye workshop.

09:02.406 --> 09:03.996
Can you go to the site alone?

09:04.756 --> 09:05.395
I can.

09:05.396 --> 09:06.955
I'll go with Damai.

09:06.956 --> 09:08.675
♫ I fall in love ♫

09:08.676 --> 09:09.926
Have breakfast.

09:10.276 --> 09:11.276
Got it.

09:12.196 --> 09:14.285
♫ And pray ♫

09:14.286 --> 09:16.106
♫ Maybe ♫

09:16.556 --> 09:17.556
See you.

09:31.756 --> 09:32.756
Go.

09:36.206 --> 09:37.716
Great. Come on.

09:38.486 --> 09:40.716
Great.

09:42.396 --> 09:44.646
Other dogs are not as cute as you.

09:45.936 --> 09:48.275
I can't accompany you until my work is done.

09:48.276 --> 09:49.276
Damai.

09:51.396 --> 09:52.555
I have to work.

09:52.556 --> 09:53.605
I won't wash my bowl.

09:53.606 --> 09:54.555
OK. Leave it alone.

09:54.556 --> 09:55.385
See you tonight.

09:55.386 --> 09:55.726
Bye-bye.

09:55.726 --> 09:56.726
Go.

09:57.756 --> 09:59.236
See you, Cuo Bazi.

10:01.676 --> 10:02.676
Go.

10:07.396 --> 10:08.605
Nana.

10:08.606 --> 10:09.206
Aunt Feng.

10:09.207 --> 10:11.245
Whose big dog?

10:11.246 --> 10:12.246
Damai's.

10:13.396 --> 10:14.596
Writer?

10:15.246 --> 10:16.635
Didn't you leave?

10:16.636 --> 10:18.756
I came back to see Hongdou and Nana.

10:19.436 --> 10:20.476
That's good.

10:20.966 --> 10:22.755
Aunt Feng. Who are you looking for?

10:22.756 --> 10:24.046
Nobody.

10:24.396 --> 10:28.205
Aunt Gui and his husband went to see
their children.

10:28.206 --> 10:30.996
I help her clean the yard for some days.

10:31.436 --> 10:33.205
Do you know how to clean?

10:33.206 --> 10:34.102
I know.

10:34.126 --> 10:35.125
Go on eating.

10:35.126 --> 10:36.126
I'm fine.

10:36.676 --> 10:38.035
What a nice dog!

10:38.036 --> 10:40.046
It will eat a lot.

10:40.396 --> 10:42.806
Aunt Feng, it eats a lot each meal.

10:43.126 --> 10:44.756
I'm going to work.

10:47.516 --> 10:48.756
Cuo Bazi.

10:56.086 --> 10:58.716
We'll go out.

11:04.206 --> 11:04.965
Morning.

11:04.966 --> 11:06.205
Morning.

11:06.206 --> 11:07.836
Cuo Bazi, good morning.

11:08.036 --> 11:08.695
Nana.

11:08.696 --> 11:09.836
Do you have a vase?

11:10.396 --> 11:11.406
Give me.

11:15.436 --> 11:16.436
Well.

11:16.606 --> 11:19.116
How about Xie's stepmother?

11:19.846 --> 11:20.996
Good.

11:22.556 --> 11:24.485
You have to get along with her.

11:24.486 --> 11:26.555
You can't just look at her surface.

11:26.556 --> 11:28.555
Maybe she'll poison you.

11:28.556 --> 11:29.635
Yes.

11:29.636 --> 11:33.166
Even a good mother-in-law
will have conflicts with you.

11:33.436 --> 11:34.885
We just met and had a meal.

11:34.886 --> 11:36.956
You think too much.

11:37.736 --> 11:38.795
Damai, have you finished?

11:38.796 --> 11:39.885
Yes. I'm waiting for you.

11:39.886 --> 11:41.155
Let's go.

11:41.156 --> 11:42.755
You shall eat first.

11:42.756 --> 11:44.085
The designer urged me.

11:44.086 --> 11:44.556
Nana.

11:44.557 --> 11:45.605
Tidy it up.

11:45.606 --> 11:46.606
OK.

11:46.726 --> 11:47.726
Go.

11:49.006 --> 11:49.845
Hongdou.

11:49.846 --> 11:51.435
Shall I give you a bottle of milk?

11:51.436 --> 11:52.926
No, it's enough.

11:53.516 --> 11:54.206
We have to go.

11:54.206 --> 11:54.605
Bye-bye.

11:54.606 --> 11:55.435
Bye-bye.

11:55.436 --> 11:58.996
I lead Cuo Bazi to play outside.

12:11.086 --> 12:12.086
Sis.

12:12.396 --> 12:13.395
To the field?

12:13.396 --> 12:14.435
To the field.

12:14.436 --> 12:15.325
Hongdou.

12:15.326 --> 12:16.675
Your friend?

12:16.676 --> 12:17.716
I'm here for fun.

12:18.246 --> 12:19.756
See you.

12:20.436 --> 12:21.876
Go, Cuo Bazi.

12:22.126 --> 12:23.126
Who is she?

12:23.436 --> 12:24.516
A girl in the village.

12:24.517 --> 12:26.837
[Open for business.
Ring the doorbell for pottery.]

12:33.246 --> 12:34.435
Yang Xu.

12:34.436 --> 12:35.156
You're back.

12:35.157 --> 12:36.635
Tuotuo.

12:36.636 --> 12:38.046
Hongdou.

12:39.246 --> 12:40.485
Your friend?

12:40.486 --> 12:41.915
She lived in the yard.

12:41.916 --> 12:42.606
I know her.

12:42.607 --> 12:44.206
You're Damai.

12:44.396 --> 12:45.836
You know everyone.

12:46.206 --> 12:47.205
Hongdou.

12:47.206 --> 12:49.555
My parents won't leave.

12:49.556 --> 12:50.716
They won't leave?

12:52.156 --> 12:54.756
It's hard to make money as a driver in Kunming?

12:55.486 --> 12:56.635
We can support ourselves.

12:56.636 --> 12:58.395
We're not used to the life there.

12:58.396 --> 12:59.406
We missed him.

12:59.636 --> 13:01.435
Since there are more tourists here,

13:01.436 --> 13:02.725
drivers are in great need.

13:02.726 --> 13:03.806
So we want to try.

13:04.036 --> 13:06.286
Tuotuo must be happy, right?

13:08.126 --> 13:08.785
Well.

13:08.786 --> 13:10.275
When will your homestay open?

13:10.276 --> 13:11.555
It's too early.

13:11.556 --> 13:12.725
Under construction.

13:12.726 --> 13:15.015
I can pick up your guests.

13:15.016 --> 13:16.885
If your car's in superb condition.

13:16.886 --> 13:17.276
OK.

13:17.276 --> 13:18.036
Let's wait.

13:18.037 --> 13:18.965
OK.

13:18.966 --> 13:19.965
Bye-bye.

13:19.966 --> 13:20.845
Hongdou.

13:20.846 --> 13:22.435
I'll visit you one day.

13:22.436 --> 13:23.395
OK.

13:23.396 --> 13:24.205
Bye-bye, Tuotuo.

13:24.206 --> 13:24.845
Bye-bye.

13:24.846 --> 13:25.876
Bye-bye.

13:26.986 --> 13:27.986
Is he cute?

13:28.276 --> 13:29.876
Tuotuo is really cute.

13:34.106 --> 13:36.236
We'd better use no more than three colors.

13:36.436 --> 13:40.885
Think about and design the font,
words and signs.

13:40.886 --> 13:41.606
Put it here.

13:41.606 --> 13:42.606
OK.

13:52.136 --> 13:53.205
President Xie.

13:53.206 --> 13:55.885
Someone offers a promotion on
"Master, hit me once more".

13:55.886 --> 13:57.755
But the fee is not high.

13:57.756 --> 13:58.915
What kind?

13:58.916 --> 13:59.926
Shelled peanut.

14:00.556 --> 14:01.395
It's good.

14:01.396 --> 14:02.485
Talk with them.

14:02.486 --> 14:03.486
OK.

14:07.276 --> 14:08.276
Aunt Feng.

14:08.756 --> 14:09.836
What's wrong?

14:15.556 --> 14:17.716
Xie Qiang will be released from prison.

14:18.086 --> 14:19.555
I think...

14:19.556 --> 14:22.125
Does your father need anyone for help?

14:22.126 --> 14:26.236
If he is willing,
shall we send Qiang directly to Kunming?

14:28.276 --> 14:30.956
My dad won't cold-shoulder him.

14:31.636 --> 14:34.326
But what does sending him there directly mean?

14:35.036 --> 14:39.585
He should first stay at home
for some days for adaptation.

14:39.586 --> 14:40.965
We should ask him what he thinks.

14:40.966 --> 14:41.966
Right?

14:42.036 --> 14:45.206
It's not appropriate to
send him there directly.

14:46.796 --> 14:49.356
I want him to stay at home for some days.

14:50.206 --> 14:52.526
But if the relatives know that,

14:53.156 --> 14:55.555
they'll come to see him.

14:55.556 --> 14:57.435
Today, they say something uncomfortable.

14:57.436 --> 14:59.446
Tomorrow, they'll do the same thing.

15:01.246 --> 15:02.956
I feel upset about that.

15:05.036 --> 15:06.036
Aunt Feng.

15:06.516 --> 15:08.236
I know you want to protect him.

15:08.796 --> 15:11.446
But Xie Qiang is in his thirties after all.

15:12.086 --> 15:13.926
How long can you protect him?

15:14.846 --> 15:15.515
Yes.

15:15.516 --> 15:16.755
It's inevitable that

15:16.756 --> 15:18.996
he'll be talked about when he's released.

15:19.516 --> 15:21.885
But don't hide him,
send him away, and let him

15:21.886 --> 15:23.646
never see relatives and friends.

15:26.846 --> 15:28.166
He made a mistake

15:28.396 --> 15:30.286
and has paid the price for it.

15:31.126 --> 15:33.085
You should give him confidence.

15:33.086 --> 15:35.435
Let him have an optimistic attitude.

15:35.436 --> 15:36.436
Right?

15:39.126 --> 15:42.605
His release from prison is good news for you.

15:42.606 --> 15:46.116
Inform relatives and friends boldly
and hold a feast.

15:46.636 --> 15:48.605
Don't delay. Ask all of them to come.

15:48.606 --> 15:49.756
Solve the problem.

15:51.326 --> 15:52.605
Hold a feast?

15:52.606 --> 15:53.205
Yes.

15:53.206 --> 15:54.206
Hold a feast.

15:54.636 --> 15:57.635
Let them know that this
is a happy event for you.

15:57.636 --> 15:59.116
Don't be laughed at.

16:00.006 --> 16:01.325
It's the most important.

16:01.326 --> 16:03.206
It's the only way to help him.

16:03.886 --> 16:07.356
How long can you protect him?

16:09.916 --> 16:10.916
Yes.

16:13.006 --> 16:14.526
Yao, you're right.

16:14.726 --> 16:17.596
He can only rely on himself
after being released.

16:18.556 --> 16:19.636
I'll hold a feast.

16:21.786 --> 16:22.786
Don't worry.

16:28.726 --> 16:29.605
OK.

16:29.606 --> 16:30.606
Just do it.

16:59.766 --> 17:00.886
You're back?

17:05.606 --> 17:06.926
I have to go out.

17:07.396 --> 17:09.316
Where are you going?

17:11.046 --> 17:13.606
I'm going to the farm with a campsite.

17:14.716 --> 17:15.716
Bye-bye.

17:18.806 --> 17:19.605
Wait!

17:19.606 --> 17:20.846
I can give you a lift.

17:23.636 --> 17:24.846
Wait!

17:25.716 --> 17:26.635
Wait!

17:26.636 --> 17:27.565
Wait!

17:27.566 --> 17:28.395
Wait!

17:28.396 --> 17:29.606
Slow down!

17:29.996 --> 17:31.475
Wait!

17:31.476 --> 17:32.565
Slow down!

17:32.566 --> 17:34.715
The road is rough. Wait!

17:34.716 --> 17:35.845
Wait!

17:35.846 --> 17:37.236
I'm coming!

17:38.156 --> 17:39.395
Stop!

17:39.396 --> 17:40.716
Get on.

17:43.676 --> 17:45.276
Be careful. The road is rough.

17:46.606 --> 17:47.646
I'm exhausted.

18:12.846 --> 18:14.206
Will it survive?

18:15.606 --> 18:16.886
I don't know.

18:18.196 --> 18:19.996
To plant fruit trees,

18:20.326 --> 18:22.675
choose the seedlings
that have grown to

18:22.676 --> 18:24.605
the size of your thumb.

18:24.606 --> 18:26.996
The survival rate is high.

18:27.846 --> 18:30.036
Isn't it also grown from a seed?

18:32.996 --> 18:34.476
I don't think it can survive.

18:36.886 --> 18:38.606
You are a little talkative today.

18:39.716 --> 18:41.716
If you're busy, you can go back.

18:44.236 --> 18:46.206
You are the same as the previous women.

18:48.436 --> 18:49.516
What do you mean?

18:49.766 --> 18:51.166
You are teasing me.

18:54.996 --> 18:56.646
How do I tease you?

18:56.916 --> 19:01.475
You always called me
Yu and treated me well.

19:01.476 --> 19:03.805
You didn't let me be
wronged and let me respect

19:03.806 --> 19:04.805
and love myself.

19:04.806 --> 19:06.606
When I become your boyfriend,

19:07.046 --> 19:08.716
you treat me differently.

19:08.916 --> 19:10.395
You don't listen to my songs.

19:10.396 --> 19:14.085
You traveled to Kunming
and Meri Snow Mountain

19:14.086 --> 19:15.406
as if nothing happened.

19:18.326 --> 19:20.086
You make unfounded countercharges.

19:20.526 --> 19:22.206
It's you who hid from me.

19:23.766 --> 19:25.556
In fact, I don't care.

19:25.956 --> 19:27.675
I'm afraid to scare you.

19:27.676 --> 19:29.206
What?

19:29.396 --> 19:31.206
Are you afraid of me pestering you?

19:32.046 --> 19:36.366
I'm a woman in my 40s and
have a 19-year-old daughter.

19:39.126 --> 19:40.476
I don't think so.

19:42.086 --> 19:43.556
Nothing to do with that.

19:45.436 --> 19:46.646
I just...

19:47.476 --> 19:49.796
I just don't get used to it.

19:52.396 --> 19:53.756
So I misunderstand you.

19:55.716 --> 19:56.886
Of course.

20:02.476 --> 20:03.476
I...

20:06.636 --> 20:08.796
really like being with you.

20:18.886 --> 20:19.956
Just OK.

20:22.806 --> 20:24.606
What do you mean?

20:25.436 --> 20:29.395
It means it's fine that you feel comfortable.

20:29.396 --> 20:30.396
I'm just OK.

20:32.476 --> 20:33.956
I'll water the vegetables.

20:34.886 --> 20:35.845
Listen.

20:35.846 --> 20:37.885
Bitter gourd vine grows fast.

20:37.886 --> 20:38.476
I'll show you.

20:38.477 --> 20:39.885
I think it's OK.

20:39.886 --> 20:41.155
What does it mean?

20:41.156 --> 20:42.236
Yu, hurry up!

20:43.086 --> 20:44.525
Take the bucket.

20:44.526 --> 20:45.526
OK.

20:57.326 --> 20:58.326
Hulu.

20:58.636 --> 20:59.885
Would you like some eggs?

20:59.886 --> 21:00.525
No.

21:00.526 --> 21:01.926
Let her help herself.

21:02.396 --> 21:03.885
OK.

21:03.886 --> 21:04.886
On her own.

21:08.286 --> 21:09.046
Xiaochun.

21:09.047 --> 21:10.535
Your cabbage.

21:10.536 --> 21:11.675
All dishes are done.

21:11.676 --> 21:12.565
Aunt Hua.

21:12.566 --> 21:14.406
Have you made a fortune?

21:15.566 --> 21:16.926
Yes.

21:17.476 --> 21:22.045
Xiangdong's shoulders need
diathermy so that he can cook.

21:22.046 --> 21:24.475
If so, the hospital will also make a fortune.

21:24.476 --> 21:25.805
It's not OK.

21:25.806 --> 21:26.955
I have no choice.

21:26.956 --> 21:29.845
We'll spend a lot of money on Huzi.

21:29.846 --> 21:30.685
Waitress.

21:30.686 --> 21:31.885
2 bottles of tamarind juice.

21:31.886 --> 21:32.845
I'm coming!

21:32.846 --> 21:33.805
Have a taste.

21:33.806 --> 21:34.806
Go on.

21:37.286 --> 21:37.916
Xiaochun.

21:37.916 --> 21:38.476
Have a taste.

21:38.476 --> 21:39.085
No, thanks.

21:39.086 --> 21:40.395
I can help myself.

21:40.396 --> 21:41.396
OK.

21:43.886 --> 21:44.325
Come on!

21:44.326 --> 21:45.285
President Zhang. Ma'am.

21:45.286 --> 21:46.285
This way.

21:46.286 --> 21:47.395
It's a great restaurant.

21:47.396 --> 21:48.805
I often visited here.

21:48.806 --> 21:49.565
Sis.

21:49.566 --> 21:49.996
Hello.

21:49.996 --> 21:50.606
Five guests.

21:50.607 --> 21:51.635
Please clean the table.

21:51.636 --> 21:51.956
OK.

21:51.957 --> 21:53.155
Here. It has five seats.

21:53.156 --> 21:53.606
OK.

21:53.606 --> 21:54.606
Thanks.

21:55.806 --> 21:57.086
Excuse me.

21:57.436 --> 21:58.156
Is she OK?

21:58.156 --> 21:59.156
Fine.

21:59.396 --> 22:00.845
I'm sorry.

22:00.846 --> 22:02.195
Let me help you.

22:02.196 --> 22:03.516
Dad!

22:04.436 --> 22:05.125
Hulu?

22:05.126 --> 22:06.276
Why are you here?

22:06.956 --> 22:08.846
I'm having lunch with mom.

22:11.196 --> 22:12.285
I'm accompanying guests.

22:12.286 --> 22:13.986
I'll see you with snacks tonight.

22:14.196 --> 22:15.196
Go back.

22:17.996 --> 22:18.606
Come on.

22:18.606 --> 22:19.396
Ma'am, this way.

22:19.396 --> 22:19.816
OK.

22:19.817 --> 22:20.715
President Zhang.

22:20.716 --> 22:23.605
Dad said he was accompanying guests.

22:23.606 --> 22:25.886
He'll see me at home.

22:26.156 --> 22:26.715
OK.

22:26.716 --> 22:27.525
I know.

22:27.526 --> 22:28.886
Shall we have lunch?

22:33.046 --> 22:35.606
What's the job of Hulu's father?

22:36.186 --> 22:37.556
He sells water purifiers.

22:39.046 --> 22:41.606
No wonder he accompanies guests every day.

22:43.576 --> 22:44.576
Have a taste.

22:49.476 --> 22:50.476
No.

22:50.806 --> 22:52.085
I lose.

22:52.086 --> 22:53.086
Stop.

22:53.236 --> 22:54.236
Ouch!

22:55.716 --> 22:57.476
I surrender.

22:58.766 --> 23:00.325
Have lunch. He can play alone.

23:00.326 --> 23:01.525
Fine.

23:01.526 --> 23:02.635
Have lunch first.

23:02.636 --> 23:03.646
Hurry up.

23:24.806 --> 23:26.366
Sorry, we're closed.

23:26.676 --> 23:28.316
Nana made an appointment.

23:30.396 --> 23:31.395
Mr. Xu?

23:31.396 --> 23:31.915
Yes.

23:31.916 --> 23:32.715
Hello.

23:32.716 --> 23:33.126
Hello.

23:33.127 --> 23:34.606
Finally, I have a chance to meet you.

23:34.886 --> 23:36.166
Any drinks?

23:36.476 --> 23:37.885
Thanks. Everything is OK.

23:37.886 --> 23:39.435
Xin, a pot of tea, please.

23:39.436 --> 23:40.372
OK.

23:40.396 --> 23:41.155
This way.

23:41.156 --> 23:42.156
OK.

23:46.956 --> 23:49.845
Yang Xuebao, from the fourth group,
insisted on a loan

23:49.846 --> 23:51.195
but had no mortgage.

23:51.196 --> 23:54.435
So he asked us to write a letter of guarantee.

23:54.436 --> 23:56.915
I told him we can't write the letter.

23:56.916 --> 23:58.915
I let him do small businesses along the street

23:58.916 --> 24:00.235
at a low cost.

24:00.236 --> 24:02.476
But he didn't agree
and insisted on a loan.

24:03.716 --> 24:07.116
Ask Yang Xuebao to come tomorrow.

24:07.346 --> 24:08.706
I'll ask him in person.

24:08.946 --> 24:09.946
OK.

24:11.146 --> 24:15.385
Li Xiaoping from the second
group wants to transform

24:15.386 --> 24:17.145
the old house into a homestay.

24:17.146 --> 24:18.876
I went to her house this morning.

24:19.126 --> 24:20.685
The roof is covered with plastic cloth.

24:20.686 --> 24:22.515
I'm afraid the wall will collapse.

24:22.516 --> 24:23.345
Too scary.

24:23.346 --> 24:25.506
No way to guarantee safety.

24:25.716 --> 24:29.156
And she doesn't want to fit up.

24:29.426 --> 24:31.876
She said she'll do that after making money.

24:32.666 --> 24:34.596
I know her.

24:34.866 --> 24:36.156
She raised chickens.

24:36.476 --> 24:39.905
But her family was lazy and
made the room stink everywhere.

24:39.906 --> 24:42.235
She wants to run a homestay?

24:42.236 --> 24:43.236
Yes.

24:48.076 --> 24:49.076
President Xie.

24:49.756 --> 24:51.235
Say something.

24:51.236 --> 24:54.715
Which family mentioned can we help?

24:54.716 --> 24:56.986
The idea is very ridiculous.

24:58.586 --> 25:00.636
It sounds ridiculous.

25:01.556 --> 25:04.706
Village Committee can persuade them,

25:04.946 --> 25:06.266
but I can't.

25:06.476 --> 25:07.905
I'm also a businessman.

25:07.906 --> 25:12.035
They may say I make money in the village

25:12.036 --> 25:14.426
but don't allow others to make money.

25:16.036 --> 25:17.036
Yao.

25:17.516 --> 25:20.266
It's really a hard bone.

25:20.666 --> 25:22.945
But you know how to do business.

25:22.946 --> 25:24.995
Give us your ideas.

25:24.996 --> 25:27.226
Tell your thoughts boldly.

25:27.516 --> 25:28.906
No outsider here.

25:29.426 --> 25:30.836
I know.

25:31.106 --> 25:33.515
But I haven't thought of any good way.

25:33.516 --> 25:35.665
The problems mentioned by Huang are tough.

25:35.666 --> 25:37.905
You can only persuade them.

25:37.906 --> 25:40.315
If Yang Xuebao borrows online loans or usury

25:40.316 --> 25:41.906
due to impulsiveness,

25:42.316 --> 25:43.946
he may be killed.

25:49.626 --> 25:51.515
Rent for the bookstore has been settled.

25:51.516 --> 25:53.715
After signing, they'll work out a plan.

25:53.716 --> 25:55.585
I think they are directly transported

25:55.586 --> 25:57.905
from the factory for assembly,

25:57.906 --> 26:00.796
so as to shorten the construction and
reduce damage.

26:01.756 --> 26:05.625
Consult with residents around the old house
in advance.

26:05.626 --> 26:08.426
Don't disturb them and cause conflicts.

26:09.076 --> 26:10.076
Got it.

26:10.516 --> 26:11.835
They're hiring.

26:11.836 --> 26:13.156
From our village.

26:13.516 --> 26:15.076
They want to do so.

26:15.426 --> 26:16.426
OK.

26:19.836 --> 26:20.876
Hongdou.

26:24.996 --> 26:26.315
Let me introduce.

26:26.316 --> 26:28.706
Xu Hongdou, boss of our village homestay,

26:29.186 --> 26:30.426
also my girlfriend.

26:31.836 --> 26:33.385
Secretary Li of the Party branch.

26:33.386 --> 26:34.105
You saw him.

26:34.106 --> 26:35.035
Hello, Mr. Li.

26:35.036 --> 26:36.316
Here we meet again.

26:37.346 --> 26:39.185
This is the village director.

26:39.186 --> 26:41.186
Hello.

26:41.666 --> 26:42.666
Good.

26:42.866 --> 26:43.866
Work hard.

26:44.276 --> 26:47.836
Let's build our village better and better.

26:48.346 --> 26:49.185
Don't worry.

26:49.186 --> 26:52.105
I'll obey any rules of our village.

26:52.106 --> 26:53.106
OK.

26:53.866 --> 26:56.076
We'll leave if there are no other problems.

26:56.346 --> 26:57.356
Finished?

26:58.386 --> 27:00.185
We just asked him for ideas.

27:00.186 --> 27:01.185
Nothing else.

27:01.186 --> 27:02.075
Shall we wait?

27:02.076 --> 27:02.715
No.

27:02.716 --> 27:05.316
I'll visit a granny with the Secretary.

27:06.186 --> 27:06.715
OK.

27:06.716 --> 27:08.356
Well, see you.

27:08.756 --> 27:09.665
Bye-bye.

27:09.666 --> 27:11.035
Director, Secretary, bye-bye.

27:11.036 --> 27:11.476
Good job.

27:11.476 --> 27:11.996
Take care.

27:11.997 --> 27:13.226
Good job.

27:19.186 --> 27:20.356
I'm exhausted.

27:21.836 --> 27:24.116
The site is equipped with monitoring,

27:24.516 --> 27:26.186
foremen and designers.

27:26.386 --> 27:27.906
Why do you keep an eye?

27:28.186 --> 27:30.865
You're afraid that it will cause trouble?

27:30.866 --> 27:34.105
There will be problems,
and they are all kinds

27:34.106 --> 27:35.796
that you can't imagine.

27:35.996 --> 27:39.186
I have to teach you a
lesson about being a boss.

27:39.516 --> 27:40.946
Teach me a lesson?

27:41.276 --> 27:43.556
You're a primary teacher?

27:43.796 --> 27:45.275
Primary?

27:45.276 --> 27:46.715
You're just in Grade 1.

27:46.716 --> 27:48.105
So I have the right.

27:48.106 --> 27:48.586
OK.

27:48.587 --> 27:50.636
Say.

27:51.186 --> 27:52.396
First lesson.

27:52.666 --> 27:54.316
Learn to rest assured.

27:54.946 --> 27:56.316
Do I need to learn that?

27:56.666 --> 27:57.945
Of course.

27:57.946 --> 27:59.596
I paid the tuition.

28:00.186 --> 28:04.836
In the beginning,
I was worried about everything.

28:05.106 --> 28:07.835
But they didn't understand me

28:07.836 --> 28:11.075
and said I didn't give them
enough space and trust them.

28:11.076 --> 28:13.185
Even Xiaochun asked me

28:13.186 --> 28:15.226
if I thought those people were not good.

28:17.426 --> 28:17.796
No.

28:17.797 --> 28:19.035
What's wrong with doing more?

28:19.036 --> 28:20.515
The work is limited.

28:20.516 --> 28:22.506
If you do more,
others will do less.

28:22.946 --> 28:25.185
You've been an employee for a long time.

28:25.186 --> 28:26.895
You haven't changed your mind.

28:26.896 --> 28:28.515
They do their own work.

28:28.516 --> 28:30.385
Boss does what he should do.

28:30.386 --> 28:32.186
Why do you invite them?

28:33.426 --> 28:36.345
You can make suggestions on their work.

28:36.346 --> 28:38.666
But don't interfere with their work too much.

28:39.076 --> 28:39.346
No.

28:39.347 --> 28:41.035
But since I pay the money,

28:41.036 --> 28:43.295
I am responsible for the final result.

28:43.296 --> 28:44.385
It's hard to rest assured.

28:44.386 --> 28:45.275
Look.

28:45.276 --> 28:46.755
It's the boss mentality.

28:46.756 --> 28:49.425
Employees should concentrate on their work.

28:49.426 --> 28:51.946
The boss should learn to trust employees

28:52.286 --> 28:54.105
and control the overall direction.

28:54.106 --> 28:56.556
One person cannot form a team.

28:58.106 --> 28:59.116
It makes sense.

28:59.906 --> 29:03.076
You should pay for the lesson.

29:04.836 --> 29:05.476
Hand.

29:05.477 --> 29:08.795
♫ Make a little wish and pray ♫

29:08.796 --> 29:09.796
Do what?

29:10.716 --> 29:11.716
Come on.

29:11.796 --> 29:12.796
For you.

29:18.996 --> 29:19.996
For return.

29:20.866 --> 29:22.906
Don't do it in public.

29:23.186 --> 29:23.426
No.

29:23.427 --> 29:25.035
It's dark. No one can see.

29:25.036 --> 29:27.605
I just think it's not good.

29:27.606 --> 29:31.005
♫ Is the joy of wind ♫

29:31.006 --> 29:33.626
♫ Wake up the stars at dusk ♫

29:35.606 --> 29:38.806
♫ Good time ♫

29:42.556 --> 29:43.596
Luo Quan?

29:44.426 --> 29:45.275
Yao?

29:45.276 --> 29:46.596
When did you come?

29:46.796 --> 29:49.185
I arrived with guests today.

29:49.186 --> 29:50.995
I just took them to the homestay.

29:50.996 --> 29:52.636
I'll buy some food for my kid.

29:54.186 --> 29:55.685
This is Hulu's dad.

29:55.686 --> 29:57.185
Xu Hongdou, my girlfriend.

29:57.186 --> 29:58.316
Hello.

29:58.666 --> 29:59.945
How is your business?

29:59.946 --> 30:01.075
Just so so.

30:01.076 --> 30:03.105
The guests bought a lot today.

30:03.106 --> 30:05.036
I may earn 5000 to 6000 yuan.

30:06.186 --> 30:07.186
Come on.

30:08.106 --> 30:09.106
Done.

30:11.516 --> 30:12.945
You shall take some.

30:12.946 --> 30:14.596
No, thanks.

30:15.276 --> 30:17.876
Granny cooked some food.

30:19.836 --> 30:20.585
OK.

30:20.586 --> 30:21.346
Go back early.

30:21.347 --> 30:22.596
She's going to bed.

30:22.836 --> 30:23.836
OK.

30:23.906 --> 30:25.475
I'll go back. Yao.

30:25.476 --> 30:26.362
Hongdou.

30:26.386 --> 30:27.275
Guanjun.

30:27.276 --> 30:28.105
Bye-bye.

30:28.106 --> 30:29.106
Take care.

30:34.386 --> 30:36.636
Xiaochun's ex-husband
equivocates a bit.

30:37.386 --> 30:38.105
Equivocate?

30:38.106 --> 30:39.266
Beat about the bush.

30:40.386 --> 30:42.715
Considering Xiaochun's characteristics,

30:42.716 --> 30:44.396
how can they live together?

30:45.316 --> 30:46.515
Did Siping leave?

30:46.516 --> 30:47.106
Yes.

30:47.107 --> 30:48.506
He's quite busy.

30:50.036 --> 30:50.625
Come on.

30:50.626 --> 30:51.626
Have a try.

30:51.906 --> 30:52.835
It's hot.

30:52.836 --> 30:53.865
OK.

30:53.866 --> 30:54.876
Which one?

30:55.516 --> 30:56.076
This one.

30:56.076 --> 30:57.076
OK.

30:58.076 --> 30:59.076
Well.

30:59.186 --> 31:02.533
Shall I pick up Xie Qiang with you
two days later?

31:02.534 --> 31:03.614
Do you want to go?

31:04.106 --> 31:05.636
If I don't go,

31:05.836 --> 31:07.746
he may think I don't care about him.

31:08.756 --> 31:10.755
OK, I'll call you.

31:10.756 --> 31:11.395
OK.

31:11.396 --> 31:12.945
We'll go to the supermarket. Bye-bye.

31:12.946 --> 31:13.946
OK.

31:14.476 --> 31:15.402
Go.

31:15.426 --> 31:15.945
Bye-bye.

31:15.946 --> 31:16.946
Bye-bye.

31:32.626 --> 31:33.515
Xiaxia's clothes.

31:33.516 --> 31:34.556
They may fit you.

31:34.996 --> 31:35.996
Thanks.

31:36.516 --> 31:37.666
Easy to wash?

31:38.346 --> 31:39.735
The oil is hard to clean.

31:39.736 --> 31:40.665
Let me help you.

31:40.666 --> 31:41.585
No, thanks. I can.

31:41.586 --> 31:42.586
Come on.

31:45.426 --> 31:46.426
Thanks.

31:49.796 --> 31:50.836
Here?

31:51.236 --> 31:52.596
Yes. On the sleeve.

31:56.476 --> 31:59.186
Your guest's family is interesting.

32:00.796 --> 32:04.706
You have to accompany them
and be a babysitter for free.

32:05.836 --> 32:07.836
It's good for the family to come out.

32:08.186 --> 32:09.986
I don't have to drink with them.

32:12.906 --> 32:14.946
You used to like drinking.

32:15.346 --> 32:16.906
Every time you're drunk,

32:17.346 --> 32:19.186
you vomit beside the stool

32:19.586 --> 32:24.036
and say you want to raise Hulu and me.

32:30.426 --> 32:31.426
Xiaochun.

32:33.186 --> 32:39.235
Is the man who ate with you today
your boyfriend?

32:39.236 --> 32:39.945
No.

32:39.946 --> 32:40.986
He's pursuing me.

32:42.106 --> 32:43.796
How about his family?

32:45.796 --> 32:47.865
Why do you want to know that?

32:47.866 --> 32:49.556
Mind your own business.

32:52.796 --> 32:53.796
Well.

32:54.386 --> 32:56.156
Have you told Hulu's grandparents

32:56.666 --> 32:58.356
about going to primary school?

33:00.276 --> 33:01.276
Yes.

33:02.906 --> 33:03.906
Then?

33:04.276 --> 33:06.876
They said it needs further discussion.

33:09.426 --> 33:11.625
They'll watch Hulu's performance.

33:11.626 --> 33:12.876
Discuss it later.

33:13.756 --> 33:15.116
They disagree.

33:21.686 --> 33:22.716
What's your idea?

33:25.186 --> 33:26.636
I listen to you.

33:27.946 --> 33:30.556
I want to know your real thoughts.

33:32.946 --> 33:33.986
Actually,

33:34.626 --> 33:36.316
it's better to study in Kunming.

33:36.756 --> 33:39.316
Besides, we bought that house

33:39.666 --> 33:41.876
because of school district housing.

33:47.996 --> 33:49.235
Are you angry?

33:49.236 --> 33:50.236
No.

33:52.516 --> 33:53.555
Xiaochun.

33:53.556 --> 33:54.746
I listen to you.

33:56.186 --> 33:58.275
You don't have to.

33:58.276 --> 34:00.396
I'll take your idea into consideration.

34:01.186 --> 34:02.826
Discuss it with your parents.

34:10.836 --> 34:12.746
Granny, pick one.

34:16.346 --> 34:17.985
Look at its pattern.

34:17.986 --> 34:18.985
Don't tell me.

34:18.986 --> 34:20.346
Don't show me.

34:20.946 --> 34:22.306
Hongdou.

34:23.116 --> 34:26.306
Look at the pattern
and keep in mind.

34:27.716 --> 34:28.786
Done.

34:34.836 --> 34:35.346
Granny.

34:35.347 --> 34:38.556
Put it in the middle.

34:41.066 --> 34:42.195
I'm shuffling now.

34:42.196 --> 34:44.436
Say "stop" to let me stop.

34:56.836 --> 34:57.836
Stop.

35:11.276 --> 35:13.275
Mind reading is not deceiving.

35:13.276 --> 35:17.156
I can see which card it
is from your expression.

35:18.986 --> 35:19.986
Granny.

35:20.196 --> 35:23.386
We should keep our faces expressionless.

35:24.196 --> 35:25.545
It's useless.

35:25.546 --> 35:27.786
Because I read your heart.

35:53.426 --> 35:56.786
I feel it must be Heart 2.

35:59.596 --> 36:01.275
Great!

36:01.276 --> 36:03.275
You can attend Spring Festival Gala.

36:03.276 --> 36:03.946
Really?

36:03.946 --> 36:05.036
Yes.

36:06.426 --> 36:07.275
I have to go.

36:07.276 --> 36:09.916
I'll find Huzi and
perform magic.

36:10.426 --> 36:11.635
Don't look for him.

36:11.636 --> 36:14.985
I'll take Damai and you to Granny Feng's house.

36:14.986 --> 36:16.036
No.

36:16.716 --> 36:17.985
To have a feast.

36:17.986 --> 36:19.996
I'm afraid.

36:21.066 --> 36:22.425
Why?

36:22.426 --> 36:26.945
Xie Qiang's arm is so
thick and he's very tall.

36:26.946 --> 36:29.195
He can break the door plank with one punch.

36:29.196 --> 36:30.025
I'm scared.

36:30.026 --> 36:31.755
Granny, I have to go.

36:31.756 --> 36:32.425
OK.

36:32.426 --> 36:33.505
Take care.

36:33.506 --> 36:34.706
Safety first.

36:35.636 --> 36:36.636
Slow down.

36:39.196 --> 36:42.226
Does she refer to
Xie Qiang or Johnson?

36:42.906 --> 36:45.866
Parents frighten kids in that way.

36:49.786 --> 36:54.106
[Qifeng Prison]

37:14.866 --> 37:15.866
Qiang!

37:16.066 --> 37:17.066
Qiang!

37:21.506 --> 37:22.026
Go.

37:22.026 --> 37:23.026
Go home.

37:33.986 --> 37:36.226
The village has changed a lot.

37:36.546 --> 37:37.545
You haven't come back.

37:37.546 --> 37:41.346
You don't know how many tourists come here.

37:43.316 --> 37:45.346
Things turn better this year.

37:45.546 --> 37:47.186
You meet a good time.

37:48.506 --> 37:49.506
Yes.

37:50.236 --> 37:52.036
My barbecue stand is also OK.

37:52.676 --> 37:53.676
Qiang.

37:53.756 --> 37:55.065
What do you want to do?

37:55.066 --> 37:56.666
Ask Yao for advice.

37:56.906 --> 38:00.036
A few years ago,
many villagers waited to see his jokes.

38:00.316 --> 38:02.916
Now they'll ask him for anything.

38:06.636 --> 38:08.386
One more thing, Xie Qiang.

38:09.636 --> 38:11.945
It's good news that you're released.

38:11.946 --> 38:13.076
There's a feast.

38:13.276 --> 38:15.386
Relatives and friends will come.

38:16.086 --> 38:17.166
One day will pass.

38:29.866 --> 38:30.276
Come on.

38:30.277 --> 38:31.755
Let me see what you work out.

38:31.756 --> 38:33.436
Thanks.

38:35.346 --> 38:36.715
I'm coming.

38:36.716 --> 38:38.226
Eat more.

38:38.676 --> 38:39.996
Thanks.

38:40.236 --> 38:41.425
Come on.

38:41.426 --> 38:42.196
Good.

38:42.196 --> 38:42.676
Eat more.

38:42.677 --> 38:44.076
Thanks.

38:45.236 --> 38:46.195
Come on.

38:46.196 --> 38:46.676
Hurry up.

38:46.676 --> 38:47.276
Eat more.

38:47.277 --> 38:48.675
Aunt Feng.

38:48.676 --> 38:50.595
Master asked when to cook.

38:50.596 --> 38:52.025
Call Yao.

38:52.026 --> 38:53.275
Ask where he is.

38:53.276 --> 38:54.755
We'll cook when he's coming.

38:54.756 --> 38:55.465
OK.

38:55.466 --> 38:56.236
Give me the pot.

38:56.236 --> 38:57.236
OK.

38:57.716 --> 38:59.315
Give me the pot.

38:59.316 --> 39:00.235
Add water.

39:00.236 --> 39:01.266
Have some tea.

39:03.506 --> 39:05.186
Drink when it's hot.

39:06.506 --> 39:08.025
Give me the pot.

39:08.026 --> 39:09.025
OK.

39:09.026 --> 39:10.235
Thank you for your work.

39:10.236 --> 39:11.235
Eat and drink more.

39:11.236 --> 39:12.956
OK. Thanks.

39:14.026 --> 39:15.996
Hongdou. Writer.

39:19.066 --> 39:20.195
I'm so happy.

39:20.196 --> 39:20.835
No.

39:20.836 --> 39:22.005
I can't accept it.

39:22.006 --> 39:22.636
You deserve it.

39:22.636 --> 39:22.986
No.

39:22.987 --> 39:25.036
I'm happy that you come.

39:25.546 --> 39:26.556
Thank you.

39:26.796 --> 39:28.115
Sit here.

39:28.116 --> 39:28.676
OK.

39:28.677 --> 39:31.635
They're the relatives of Chang and me.

39:31.636 --> 39:32.465
You don't know.

39:32.466 --> 39:32.796
OK.

39:32.797 --> 39:34.596
Have some tea.

39:35.316 --> 39:36.066
No, thanks.

39:36.067 --> 39:37.065
Go on with your work.

39:37.066 --> 39:37.596
OK.

39:37.597 --> 39:38.595
We can help ourselves.

39:38.596 --> 39:39.746
OK.

39:40.196 --> 39:41.346
I'm quite happy.

39:42.116 --> 39:43.195
I'll go on cooking.

39:43.196 --> 39:43.836
OK.

39:43.836 --> 39:44.425
Aunt Feng.

39:44.426 --> 39:45.805
Yao is coming soon.

39:45.806 --> 39:46.465
Hurry up.

39:46.466 --> 39:47.116
Xiaxia.

39:47.117 --> 39:48.545
Hello, Hongdou and Damai.

39:48.546 --> 39:50.195
You're the representative?

39:50.196 --> 39:52.155
I'm here to help Aunt Feng.

39:52.156 --> 39:52.676
Go on.

39:52.677 --> 39:53.956
I'll go to the kitchen.

39:54.276 --> 39:55.276
Eat.

39:59.386 --> 40:02.635
Is it unsuitable that
you take me to the feast?

40:02.636 --> 40:05.465
Villagers usually have a feast at night.

40:05.466 --> 40:06.505
Feng knows you're here.

40:06.506 --> 40:07.795
She asked me to take you.

40:07.796 --> 40:09.195
She said you're great.

40:09.196 --> 40:11.545
You make her proud in front of her relatives.

40:11.546 --> 40:12.945
How happy she is!

40:12.946 --> 40:14.596
I have never seen her so happy.

40:15.506 --> 40:16.506
Great?

40:16.796 --> 40:18.156
Am I great?

40:19.316 --> 40:20.316
You're great.

40:20.396 --> 40:20.906
A bit great.

40:20.907 --> 40:22.556
Let me introduce.

40:22.756 --> 40:26.996
This is Hongdou,
Yao's girlfriend.

40:27.466 --> 40:29.545
She's pretty and capable.

40:29.546 --> 40:33.156
She's the boss of the homestay.

40:34.866 --> 40:35.635
Yes.

40:35.636 --> 40:37.636
This girl is greater.

40:37.836 --> 40:38.905
She's a writer.

40:38.906 --> 40:42.226
She makes money online by writing articles.

40:42.676 --> 40:44.275
They're very busy.

40:44.276 --> 40:46.275
They spare some time to come.

40:46.276 --> 40:48.386
Let's welcome!

40:50.116 --> 40:51.385
Thank you.

40:51.386 --> 40:52.386
Have some food.

40:58.026 --> 41:00.266
Embarrassing.

41:00.946 --> 41:01.946
Fine.

41:02.676 --> 41:03.676
Eat.

41:07.276 --> 41:10.195
Shall I explain to Aunt Feng?

41:10.196 --> 41:11.306
What?

41:12.546 --> 41:16.596
Explain that I am a 28-year-old online writer.

41:17.026 --> 41:19.425
I can't even write an update.

41:19.426 --> 41:21.235
And I'm worried about subscriptions.

41:21.236 --> 41:24.675
My articles are blocked and robbed.

41:24.676 --> 41:25.676
And...

41:27.756 --> 41:28.866
Food.

41:31.716 --> 41:34.076
And I can't even sell the copyright.

41:35.506 --> 41:36.996
Authors like me

41:37.756 --> 41:40.826
get the worst scolding and beating.

41:41.066 --> 41:44.516
I have a hunch that I won't
even pay taxes next year

41:45.756 --> 41:47.666
with my low reading volume.

41:48.426 --> 41:50.076
I strive for no loss next year.

41:51.596 --> 41:53.116
Good goal.

41:53.546 --> 41:54.546
Nice.

41:59.026 --> 42:00.996
Boss Xu, have a baby soon.

42:02.796 --> 42:04.956
Wish you great fortune.

42:28.466 --> 42:29.916
Mom said she wanted to

42:30.796 --> 42:32.436
repair this wall.

42:36.946 --> 42:40.306
Since you're back,
you can repair it at any time.

42:40.546 --> 42:41.596
I'll help you.

42:47.466 --> 42:48.516
Come in.

42:48.986 --> 42:51.076
Your parents are waiting for you.

42:52.466 --> 42:53.945
Go.

42:53.946 --> 42:54.946
Be happy.

42:55.506 --> 42:57.275
I cooked the melon seeds myself.

42:57.276 --> 42:59.346
Aunt Feng, he's back.

43:15.636 --> 43:16.636
Dad.

43:18.546 --> 43:19.546
Qiang.

43:29.466 --> 43:30.466
Mom.

43:33.716 --> 43:34.786
You're back.

43:36.346 --> 43:37.346
You're back.

43:39.236 --> 43:40.236
Son.

43:44.636 --> 43:47.266
Go to see your grandma.

43:48.596 --> 43:49.916
Qiang.

43:56.026 --> 43:57.026
Grandma.

43:57.316 --> 43:58.636
You're back.

44:00.636 --> 44:01.636
Good.

44:02.636 --> 44:03.826
Good.

44:11.506 --> 44:12.746
Don't cry.

44:12.986 --> 44:13.986
Don't cry.

44:14.386 --> 44:15.386
Son.

44:15.836 --> 44:16.836
Yes.

44:16.906 --> 44:18.516
Play cards with your dad.

44:19.506 --> 44:21.076
No seat here.

44:21.276 --> 44:23.116
Sit with young people.

44:23.636 --> 44:24.155
Yao.

44:24.156 --> 44:25.386
Let him sit with you.

44:26.466 --> 44:27.635
He's just back.

44:27.636 --> 44:29.755
Let him change clothes
and wash his face in the room.

44:29.756 --> 44:30.276
Yes.

44:30.276 --> 44:31.066
Prepare for lunch.

44:31.066 --> 44:31.426
Yes.

44:31.427 --> 44:32.595
Come in.

44:32.596 --> 44:33.795
Change clothes.

44:33.796 --> 44:35.795
The clothes are on the bed.

44:35.796 --> 44:36.835
Good.

44:36.836 --> 44:37.836
Good.

44:40.836 --> 44:42.235
Go on eating.

44:42.236 --> 44:42.986
Go on eating.

44:42.987 --> 44:44.195
OK.

44:44.196 --> 44:48.315
I always thought he
should be tall and strong.

44:48.316 --> 44:50.436
But he looks common.

44:50.686 --> 44:53.115
He was sent to prison
for stealing instead of

44:53.116 --> 44:55.116
being a thug for the underworld.

44:56.196 --> 44:57.226
Yes.

